{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_tiujmt3i2stvgac5hwxdcw6yqdwytkqy5oo3w5zb7a5z325dy3za","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built all 11 Balance screens in **03 · Workspace**, along with a component library, a tokens board and a working prototype. I checked every screen in screenshots and fixed what looked wrong. The reference pages (00, 01, 02, 04) were not touched. The account is fulinbo@tetras.ai, as required.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/MBHvOG7BDhv7MBK9aeD1M4/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `2002:2`\n\n**Screen IDs**\n| Frame | ID | Frame | ID |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 01_Sign_Up | 2013:480 | 07_Cards | 2018:1281 |\n| 02_OTP | 2013:529 | 08_Profile | 2018:1598 |\n| 03_Home_My_Balance | 2013:614 | 09_Analytics | 2018:1902 |\n| 04_Home_Upcoming_Bills | 2013:836 | 10_Markets | 2018:2035 |\n| 05_Home_Transactions | 2013:1037 | 11_Send | 2018:2270 |\n| 06_Discussion_Forum | 2018:1106 | | |\n\n**Design system**\n- **Tokens:** I defined every color beyond the fixed brand color #BFB7FD as variables: text, surfaces, borders, success/error/warning/disabled and chart colors. There are also variables for spacing and corner radii, 11 Plus Jakarta Sans text styles and 2 shadow styles. The board showing them is `2022:2087`.\n- **Components** (frame `2007:3`), each with its states:\n  - Navigation and headers: the tab bar (one variant per current tab), headers, and the Home view switch and Income/Expenses switch.\n  - Buttons and inputs: button states built on the 02 Button, chips, empty/focused/filled code boxes, and a phone field built on the 02 Text Field.\n  - Business components: balance card, contact item, bill card, transaction row (money in / money out), asset row and tile, payment card (Green/Pink/Purple), card row, forum post (liked / not liked), recipient card and keypad keys.\n  - Charts: the 7-day spending bars, the income donut and the candlestick chart.\n- All logos, card art, flags, icons and avatars are instances from 04 · Media, and the status bar and home indicator come from 02. Copy and data follow \"Fixed data\". Devon Lane's post shows as liked, all 4 code boxes are empty, and amounts are signed and colored green for money in.\n\n**Prototype:** 44 click interactions, starting from 01_Sign_Up.\n- Onboarding: 01 → 02 → 03, and back from 02 to 01.\n- The Home views (03, 04, 05) switch between each other. Messages on all three opens 06.\n- From 03: Send → 11, Bessie Cooper → 11, Financial health details → 09.\n- The four tabs work on 03, 04, 05, 07, 08 and 09.\n- Back goes to 03 from 06, 07, 08, 09 and 11; back on 10 goes to 07.\n- Bitcoin on 07 → 10, See all on 08 → 05, and Send on 11 → 03.\n\n**Things to know**\n- **Extras beyond the brief:** I added links the brief didn't list: back on 08 → 03, and Messages → 06 on 04 and 05. I also added a little copy: the \"Aug 20, 2023\" date under the greeting, the subtitle \"We sent a 4-digit code to +62 858 2409 3560\" on 02, \"Didn't get it?\" before \"Resend code\", and section titles like \"Primary card\" and \"Income breakdown\".\n- **Unwired buttons:** buttons without a target screen in the brief (Receive, Add, Pay now, Buy/Sell, Filter, the keypad and others) are designed but not linked, since the brief has no screens for them.\n- **Scrolling:** 03, 07 and 09 are set to scroll vertically, with the status bar and tab bar fixed. On 03, the bottom padding of the Financial health card sits just under the tab bar's top edge; the chart itself is fully visible.\n- **Profile cards:** on 08, \"Your Cards\" is a list of three rows with small card images rather than full-size cards, so all three fit on screen."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":165216,"cache_read_input_tokens":7731,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":165216,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"