n- **Extras beyond the brief:** I added links the brief didn't list: back on 08 → 03, and Messages → 06 on 04 and 05. I also added a little copy: the \"Aug 20, 2023\" date under the greeting, the subtitle \"We sent a 4-digit code to +62 858 2409 3560\" on 02, \"Didn't get it?\" before \"Resend code\", and section titles like \"Primary card\" and \"Income breakdown\".\n- **Unwired buttons:** buttons without a target screen in the brief (Receive, Add, Pay now, Buy/Sell, Filter, the keypad and others) are designed but not linked, since the brief has no screens for them.\n- **Scrolling:** 03, 07 and 09 are set to scroll vertically, with the status bar and tab bar fixed. On 03, the bottom padding of the Financial health card sits just under the tab bar's top edge; the chart itself is fully visible.\n- **Profile cards:** on 08, \"Your Cards\" is a list of three rows with small card images rather than full-size cards, so all three fit on screen.","ttft_ms":3619,"type":"result","duration_ms":1505720,"uuid":"e1938031-f1ba-4970-988f-103b6fad42b2","ttft_stream_ms":3219,"time_to_request_ms":83,"first_content_frame_ms":3219,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5/awsb_L/sfa":{"inputTokens":1913,"outputTokens":99667,"cacheReadInputTokens":437878,"cacheCreationInputTokens":3703814,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":20.607637600000007,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":26412,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}

